{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4053, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3824, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4058, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "f1f7fad6f1f4f0bcf7d1", "baseline_text": "전투 개시…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "戦闘開始……", "pointer_offset": 3828, "unit": "dialogue:04a693da3f440b04", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 5019, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0f3f7d12f2ff99cf64cf944f1acf25af8aaf64cf1488144", "baseline_text": "이 시합은…//내 패가 보너스 패야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合は……//ボクのパイがボーナスパイだよ。", "pointer_offset": 3832, "unit": "dialogue:40cc3b6695f66aa6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4118, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff157f7d12f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f5c2f0c82f2ff1e1f15ff957f299f8b2f14ef28af7d1", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는…//이 중에서，어느 한 쌍을//맞추는 것이 조건…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題……//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえることが条件……", "pointer_offset": 3836, "unit": "dialogue:0a75081017f886d4", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4181, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f15781432f2ff19cf944f5f3f0c7f148f7d1", "baseline_text": "이번에는，//내가 딜러야…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は、//ボクが親だ……", "pointer_offset": 3840, "unit": "dialogue:c9ef0109e32e58cd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 5050, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0f381432f2ff0e2f0e4f8b2f5f3f0c7f148f7d1", "baseline_text": "다음은，//대장이 딜러야…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は、//隊長が親だよ……", "pointer_offset": 3844, "unit": "dialogue:a8409284972c1e87", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4231, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f19cf944f0b2f3bbf15af7d1", "baseline_text": "내가 이겼어…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ボクの勝ちだ……", "pointer_offset": 3848, "unit": "dialogue:a25815e267b551fa", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4248, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f1cff8f3f1bdf25ef0b2f1f3f15af7d12f2ff2b4f8bcf0e2f0e4f0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "좋은 싸움이었어…//역시 대장이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いい戦いだった……//さすがは隊長だね。", "pointer_offset": 3852, "unit": "dialogue:15467b402f7841f0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4287, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f1c3f1c8f3d2f15a8143f0e2f0e481442f2ff3cff1f7f8c8f3caf144f94bf2658144", "baseline_text": "즐거웠어，대장．//재전을 허가해 줘．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "楽しかった、隊長。//再戦を許可してほしい。", "pointer_offset": 3856, "unit": "dialogue:623463263a583597", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4330, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0cffac3f26af0e2f957f0bbf0aef0db81442f2ff2ddf0a5f29ef0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff484f19c8143f0e2f0e48144", "baseline_text": "다음 상대는 글리신．//강하겠지만…//힘내，대장．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次の相手は、グリシーヌ。//手強いだろうけど……//しっかりね。", "pointer_offset": 3860, "unit": "dialogue:1dfcf0f805cf222a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4391, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3864, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4414, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3868, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4437, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f3cff1f7f257f14381482f2ff99cf24ef0c0f157f7d12f2ff0b2f8abf3a1f259f15a8144", "baseline_text": "재전할래？//내 준비는…//이미 끝났어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "再戦する？//ボクの用意は……//もうできているよ。", "pointer_offset": 3872, "unit": "dialogue:33c3f16ca520eaff", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0014", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4980, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f7d1f2c9f2e9f15a81442f2ff0cff2c3f0b9f0f4f7d1f0a4f8a4f287f8c8f1c8f0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "…알았어．//다음에도…지지 않을 거니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……了解。//次も……負けないからね。", "pointer_offset": 3876, "unit": "dialogue:7b8fd047e6eccdd3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0015", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4523, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f1e5f178f8f4f140f0eff14b81442f2ffbf4f3498143f0e2f0e4f7d1", "baseline_text": "휴식도 중요해．//또 봐，대장…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "休養も大事だ。//またね、隊長……", "pointer_offset": 3880, "unit": "dialogue:c0a61240bbad5de1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN#0016", "file": "MINIGAME/JT07RENI.SBN", "offset": 4556, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f19cf944f0b2f3bbf15af7d1", "baseline_text": "내가 이겼어…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ボクの勝ちだ……", "pointer_offset": 3884, "unit": "dialogue:a25815e267b551fa", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
